changes.text:
Created "Heroes Of Might and Magic III CRACK" as a Heroes III save cracker. Cracks three editions of Heroes: "The Restoration of Erathia" (The Restoration of Erathia), "Armageddon's Blade" (Armageddon's Blade), "The Shadow of Death" (The Shadow of Death).
Can:
- hack resources;
- hack the Hero's attributes, units, artifacts, magic, skills;
More in the program's "Help".
